Error: `check` makes observations, and it can run after a `report`
   ╭─[ test.probl:5:9 ]
   │
 5 │ let b = check(a)
   │         ────┬───  
   │             ╰───── runs after the report on line 4
   │ 
   │ Help: move the observations before the report, or the report after them
   │ 
   │ Note: a report describes the evidence observed before it, so later observations would change its meaning
